{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12102120","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12102120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1210212001:0":{"text":"이봐, 너희 뭐야?! 여긴 금지구역이라 들어오면 안 돼!","source_cn":"喂，你们从哪来的？！这里是禁区，不得入内！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC777BE04588C7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210212002:1":{"text":"오해예요! 누가 우리한테 이 길을 따라가면 페르세포네를 낚을 수 있을 거라고 했어요.","source_cn":"一定是误会了！有人告诉我们沿着这条路走，可以钓到冥湾美人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4EC9F0B9A0BE4FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210212003:1":{"text":"...누가 그렇게 알려줬다고?","source_cn":"……有人告诉你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB91DB130D2FE67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210212004:0":{"text":"이봐들, 여기 <style=\"highlight\">바다 전갈이 있어</style>! 사람을 불러 와!","source_cn":"兄弟们，这里有<style=highlight>海蝎子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x133BAD421234AC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210212005:1":{"text":"바다 전갈이요? 아니, 아니에요, 저는 햄스터, 햄스터 서머너예요!","source_cn":"海蝎子？不不不，我是仓鼠，仓鼠使魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2872F2457BE3EDF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_